OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,FBolton goalkeeper Gavin Bazunu has
OL,8,Fconfirmed he has refused to
OL,9,Fparticipate in the Republic of
OL,10,FIreland's controversial Nations League
OL,11,Ffixtures with Israel as a matter of
OL,12,F"principle".
OL,14,FThe sides are still set to face one
OL,15,Fanother at the Nagyerdei Stadium in
OL,16,FDebrecen, Hungary, on Sunday in front
OL,17,Fof a limited number of Israel fans for
OL,18,Fthe Israelis' "home" clash after
OL,19,FRepublic players voted to honour the
OL,20,Ffixture following a four-hour summit
OL,21,Fat the team hotel on Saturday.
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@KO]zD@OOUzD@TO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,FThat emergency meeting was called
OL,8,Fafter the Football Association of
OL,9,FIreland confirmed one player ` now
OL,10,Funderstood to be Bazunu ` told head
OL,11,Fcoach Heimir Hallgrimsson of his
OL,12,Fintent to withdraw from the squad on
OL,13,FSaturday morning after expressing
OL,14,Fdiscomfort about fulfilling the
OL,15,Ffixture.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,FWriting on Instagram, Bazunu said in
OL,8,Fhis statement: "Representing my
OL,9,Fcountry means everything to me. I have
OL,10,Fthe utmost respect for every single
OL,11,Fone of my team-mates, the manager, his
OL,12,Fstaff, and the Irish people.
OL,14,F"However, I have reached a decision
OL,15,Fthat I have not taken lightly. I am a
OL,16,Fman of strong faith, and try my best
OL,17,Fto be a person of character and
OL,18,Fprinciple, therefore I feel it would
OL,19,Fbe wrong to participate in the
OL,20,Fupcoming fixtures against Israel.
OL,26,@pD@POUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,F"My decision is based purely on my
OL,8,Fpersonal belief that the killing of
OL,9,Finnocent people is wrong.
OL,11,F"It is important to note that my
OL,12,Fstance is not in opposition of the
OL,13,FIsraeli people or the Jewish
OL,14,Fcommunity, but against the atrocities
OL,15,Fin the region.
OL,17,F"There are a few times where you get a
OL,18,Fchance in life to stand up for
OL,19,Fsomething bigger, and I strongly
OL,20,Fbelieve that this is one of them."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU|D@bO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
