OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThe Republic next travel to Dublin to
OL,13,Fplay Austria on Thursday, then face
OL,14,FIsrael again on Sunday behind closed
OL,15,Fdoors in Backa Topola, Serbia, in
OL,16,Ftheir "home" tie.
OL,26,@xD@GOUxD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/12
