FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,FFootball Association of Ireland chief
OL,8,FDavid Courell, in a press conference
OL,9,Fpostponed by over five hours, said:
OL,10,F"The squad were in Pristina yesterday,
OL,11,Fand an extensive conversation took
OL,12,Fplace where ultimately the consensus
OL,13,Fwas to travel to Hungary.
OL,15,F"That was something that we all
OL,16,Fentered into this window with our
OL,17,Fintention to fulfil these fixtures,
OL,18,Fand that was the consensus that the
OL,19,Fgroup finished on at the end of that
OL,20,Ftwo-hour meeting yesterday.
OL,26,@rD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,F"This morning, a player expressed
OL,8,Ftheir discomfort with fulfilling this
OL,9,Ffixture to the head coach, and
OL,10,Findicated their intent to withdraw
OL,11,Ffrom the squad. As you can understand,
OL,12,Fthis new variable required time and
OL,13,Fdeliberation for the rest of the squad
OL,14,Fto consider.
OL,16,F"What proceeded was another four hours
OL,17,Fof conversations, predominantly
OL,18,Famongst the players themselves, but
OL,19,Falso at times with the coaching staff
OL,20,Fand at times with the executive.
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,F"There were a lot of positions
OL,8,Fpresented, and I think it is important
OL,9,Fto say that from an association
OL,10,Fperspective and for everyone involved
OL,11,Fin those conversations, we were fully
OL,12,Frespectful for everyone's right to
OL,13,Ftheir respective opinion on these
OL,14,Ftopics.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,F"Ultimately, within maybe the last 90
OL,8,Fminutes, we carried out a vote amongst
OL,9,Fthe squad to establish their sentiment
OL,10,Fon fulfilling the fixtures, and it was
OL,11,Fa significant majority that was
OL,12,Freturned with the intention to
OL,13,Fcontinue."
OL,15,FCourell also revealed the Republic
OL,16,Fintend to wear black armbands on
OL,17,FSunday, "in recognition of all the
OL,18,Flives lost in the conflict", and
OL,19,Frefrain from parts of the pre-match
OL,20,Fceremony, including handshakes and the
OL,21,Fpennant exchange.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@JO]yD@IOUzD@[O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,FHe also said players have requested to
OL,8,F"effectively remove their media
OL,9,Fobligations" for the rest of the
OL,10,Finternational window.
OL,12,FAsked to verify if only one player
OL,13,Fwill not be part of his squad on
OL,14,FSunday, Hallgrimsson said: "All the
OL,15,Frest of the players are training
OL,16,Ftoday. Obviously the balance changed
OL,17,Fwith this, so it's an ongoing
OL,18,Fdiscussion.
OL,26,@pD@AOUqD@LO]vD@\OU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,F"We haven't come to a kind of
OL,8,Fconclusion on this, but we are going
OL,9,Fahead; the game is going ahead. We're
OL,10,Fgoing to train, and there will be more
OL,11,Fdiscussions tonight and probably
OL,12,Ftomorrow."
OL,14,FFormer Republic manager Brian Kerr
OL,15,Fdescribed Bazunu's decision as
OL,16,F"heroic" during an appearance on
OL,17,FVirgin Media's coverage of England's
OL,18,FNations League defeat to Spain.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@JO]xD@AOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/12
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
