PN,30312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790515119
OL,3,CRepublic of Ireland goalkeeper Gavin
OL,4,CBazunu says he will not play against
OL,5,CIsrael
OL,7,FKerr said he had spoken to the former
OL,8,FSouthampton goalkeeper and that he was
OL,9,F"feeling quite low" and "shunned by
OL,10,Fsome of the players and the FAI".
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@SO]qD@YOUrD@`O]
